{
  "name": "析米克符鎮兵Simic Keyrune",
  "type": "equipment",
  "img": "icons/commodities/treasure/trinket-totem-bone-green.webp",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<div class=\"WordSection1\" style=\"LAYOUT-GRID:15.6pt none\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN:left\">珊瑚coral、珠母貝、鉻黃聚合在一起，飾以螺殼再精雕細琢出析米克風格的裝飾圖樣與頂端的水生生物貝殼。它將在你命令下變成具有爪鉤Grabber及牢固附肢Stabilizing Legs特性的<strong>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack-zh-tw.monsterspack.Actor.zSY6p0P548HWuljs]{融合體一型category 1 krasis}</strong></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN:left\">，持續至多5小時。<br /></p><div class=\"WordSection1\" style=\"LAYOUT-GRID:15.6pt none\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN:left\">爪鉤Grabber：<span style=\"WORD-SPACING:0px;FLOAT:none;ORPHANS:2;WIDOWS:2;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\">當融合體以爪擊命中一生物時，目標被一隻專門用於抓取的附肢擒抱（逃脫的</span>DC13<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:10pt;COLOR:black\">），融合體只能同時擒抱一個生物。</span></p><div class=\"WordSection1\" style=\"LAYOUT-GRID:15.6pt none\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN:left\">牢固附肢Stabilizing Legs：<span style=\"WORD-SPACING:0px;FLOAT:none;ORPHANS:2;WIDOWS:2;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\">融合體擁有一些形似蟹肢的腿，因此它進行對抗使其倒地效應的力量和敏捷豁免是具有優勢。</span></p></div></div></div>",
